sequenceDiagram
    participant M as menu.js
    participant A as web/api.py
    participant B as BackupService
    participant F as backup/formats.py
    participant R as SqliteRecipeRepository
    M->>A: POST /api/import (multipart file)
    A->>B: import_file(bytes)
    B->>B: UTF-8 decode, json.loads
    B->>F: check marker "home-cookbook-export" + format_version
    alt not an export / damaged / over 5 MB
        A-->>M: 400 not_an_export (nothing changed)
    else format_version newer than the app
        A-->>M: 400 newer_version (nothing changed)
    else known version
        B->>F: upgrade(doc) step by step v_found to CURRENT
        B->>F: from_document(doc, now) (every recipe through parse_draft, count check)
        B->>R: live_title_keys()
        Note over B: same title as app: skip, repeated inside file: free_title adds " (2)"
        B->>R: add_many(new recipes) in one transaction
        alt clash with a save made meanwhile
            R-->>B: rollback, DuplicateTitle
            A-->>M: 409 import_interrupted (nothing changed)
        else ok
            A-->>M: 200 {imported, skipped, renamed, message}
        end
    end
